---
description: Keep project code unwritten until Learn Coach has exported the architecture decisions.
alwaysApply: true
---

If the open workspace has `.learn-coach/session.json` and its `exportedAt` field is null, do not create or edit application source, config, or tests.

Use the learn-coach MCP tools, in order: `start_session`, `next_question`, `record_answer`, `export_decisions`. Record the student's own reason. Do not pick an option for them.

When `exportedAt` is set, `DECISIONS.md` and `PLAN.md` in that project are the architecture record. Do not change a recorded choice unless the student asks.

If `.learn-coach/session.json` does not exist, this rule does not restrict edits.
